 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "The adjunction $Rf_!\\dashv Rf^!$ on $D^+$",
 "statement": "Under the hypotheses of [def-sfb-finite-shriek-adjunction] and\n[def-sfb-finite-upper-shriek-plus], the functor $Rf_!^+$ of\n[def-sfb-finite-derived-lower-shriek-plus] is left adjoint to $Rf^{!,+}$:\n\n$$\nRf_!^+\\dashv Rf^{!,+},\n$$\n\nthe restriction of the adjunction $Rf_!\\dashv Rf^!$ of [def-sfb-finite-shriek-adjunction].",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/main-20261015/blueprint/sec-six-functors-basics/sk-def-sfb-finite-upper-shriek/def-sfb-finite-shriek-adjunction-plus.md",
