 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "The inclusions $\\iota\\colon D^+\\subseteq D$ are fully faithful, and both functors are\nrestrictions: $\\iota\\circ Rf_!^+\\cong Rf_!\\circ\\iota$\n([def-sfb-finite-derived-lower-shriek-plus-compat]) and $\\iota\\circ Rf^{!,+}=Rf^!\\circ\\iota$\n([def-sfb-finite-upper-shriek-plus]). An adjunction between functors that restrict along\nfully faithful functors restricts:\n$\\Hom(Rf_!^+K,L)\\cong\\Hom(Rf_!\\iota K,\\iota L)\\cong\\Hom(\\iota K,Rf^!\\iota L)\n\\cong\\Hom(K,Rf^{!,+}L)$.",
   "uses": [
    "def-sfb-finite-derived-lower-shriek-plus-compat",
    "def-sfb-finite-upper-shriek-plus"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
